    "question": {
      ":question/id": "19841212-90b6-5cf8-a402-fefc302ce7e8",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix $B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.$ Find ${B}^{2}.$\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"3\">${B}^{2}=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-3}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-4}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">$11$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-5}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To find ${B}^{2},$ we multiply $B$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{B}^{2} & =B\\cdot B \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 11 & -3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
